/201804/2018041014025763.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201804/2018041014025741.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">月</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>24</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">日至</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>28</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">日，香港仁济医院罗陈楚思中学的师生一行来到我校，进行了为期</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">天的交流访问。作为友好结对学校，香港仁济罗中的此次来访是年度例行访问安排，但对于两校参与互访结对的每一位学生而言，每一天都饱含盛情、充满着全新的美好体验。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">万里相逢，倾盖如故。香港的同学初抵绍兴，便迅速融入本地家庭，体验一中学子的周末生活。在我校结对同学的精心准备和热情款待下，远道而来的客人们先后游览了鲁迅故居、兰亭、沈园、大禹陵、安昌古镇等名胜，真切地领略了历史文化名城的绰约风姿。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">短暂的周末家庭体验之后，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>26</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">日周一校园学习生活体验正式开启。上午七时许，我校在树兰楼三楼会议室举行正式欢迎仪式，欢迎远道来访的香港师生。校长朱雯、常务副校长陈柏良、对外交流中心主任王晶晶和全体参与活动的两校学生共同出席。为锻炼学生能力，欢迎仪式以学生展示为主，我校同学自主设计仪式流程，准备发言内容，向远道而来客人们表达了诚挚的欢迎，并围绕我校办学历史、校园文化、社团活动和对外交流等内容，向香港师生展示了百年一中的办学品质和一中学子的激扬风采。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><FONT face=Calibri> <SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">欢迎仪式后，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">来访师生走进课堂</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">，体验一中的课堂教学、师生互动、课间休憩、三餐饮食、早晚自习等。对于他们而言，一切都是新鲜有趣的。对于一中学生而言，这样的接待不仅是“有朋自远方来”的新奇与喜悦，更是一份责任担当与形象展示。一位参与活动的同学说：“我是他们的朋友，也是他们的向导，等他们离开后回想起我时，同时也会回想起绍兴一中，想起绍兴。这也是我对家乡的一点小小的贡献，是我的荣幸与骄傲。”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>28</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">日上午，访问交流进入尾声。怀着惜别的心情，同学们在学校“养新书藏”图书馆南侧合影留念，依依话别。过去，绍兴一中和</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">罗陈楚思中学的</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">渊源其来有自；未来，两校将更加紧密联结，通过各种交流活动、合作项目，求同存异，携手共进。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">一直以来，绍兴一中秉承“求真”校训，践行培育具有</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">放眼世界，面向未来，博雅通达</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">的完全人格的未来世界精英办学理念，不仅注重提高学生的知识水平，更重视培养学生的能力眼界、胸襟气度，通过丰富多彩的对外交流活动，一中学子了解五湖四海的同龄人，也更清楚地了解自己，胸怀世界，筑梦成才。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><FONT face=Calibri> <SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 280pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 20.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">（对外交流中心供稿）</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P align=center> </P>
    
